{
  "page_id": "MT-20",
  "section_header": "MANUAL TRANSMISSION — W58 Transmission",
  "title": "REPLACE OIL SEAL ON SPEEDOMETER DRIVEN GEAR / IF NECESSARY, REPLACE OIL SEAL AND BUSHING",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "13. REPLACE OIL SEAL ON SPEEDOMETER DRIVEN GEAR"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Using SST, remove the oil seal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09921-00010",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Illustration showing hands using SST tool to remove oil seal from speedometer driven gear",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 3,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(b) Using SST, install a new oil seal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09201-60011",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Oil seal depth: 25 mm (0.98 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Cross-section diagram showing 25mm depth measurement for oil seal installation using SST",
      "labels": [
        "25mm",
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 23,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "14. IF NECESSARY, REPLACE OIL SEAL AND BUSHING"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Using SST, remove the oil seal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09308-00010",
      "description": "or"
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "",
      "number": "09308-10010",
      "description": "w/ output shaft installed"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Illustration showing SST tool removing oil seal from transmission extension housing with output shaft",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 42,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(b) Heat the extension to 80 — 100°C (176 — 212°F) in an oil bath."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(c) Using SST, remove the bushing and install a new bushing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09307-30010",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Illustration showing SST tool removing/installing bushing in extension housing",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 62,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(d) Using SST, drive in a new oil seal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09325-20010",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Illustration showing SST tool driving in new oil seal into extension housing",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 81,
        "left": 4,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 17
      }
    }
  ]
